    {
      "text": "a famine in the land, Gen. 12:10 (26:1; Ruth 1:1; Abr. 1:29). seven years of famine, Gen. 41:27 (2 Sam. 24:13; 1 Chr. 21:12). famine shall consume the land, Gen. 41:30. famine was very sore, Gen. 47:13. no rain … land yield not her fruit, Deut. 11:17. famine in the days of David, 2 Sam. 21:1. there shall not be dew nor rain these years, 1 Kgs. 17:1. great famine in Samaria, 2 Kgs. 6:25. Lord hath called for a famine, 2 Kgs. 8:1 (Ps. 105:16). By sword and famine, Jer. 14:15. famine was sore in the city, Jer. 52:6 (2 Kgs. 25:3). skin was black … because of the terrible famine, Lam. 5:10. not a famine of bread … but of hearing the words of the Lord, Amos 8:11.",
